{{!-- Rendered inside a {{#post}} block context. Ghost's {{authors}}
  helper returns a comma-separated list that honours multi-author posts
  and falls back to the primary author automatically. `autolink="true"`
  wraps each name in an <a> so reader can jump to the author page — we
  keep it enabled because the author archive is a first-class feature. --}}
{{#if primary_author}}
  <p class="post-author">
    {{{t "By {authors}" authors=(authors autolink="true" separator=", ")}}}
  </p>
{{/if}}
